    <briefdescription>
<para>Runs in the terminal that the client opens for a launch. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Both platforms create the target suspended, send the target&apos;s process ID, and read the adapter&apos;s reply. The target runs only after the debugger resumes it. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
